WEBVTT

00:00:01.150 --> 00:00:02.290
Gainos.

00:00:02.290 --> 00:00:04.870
The ruling continent of the Queen's capital.

00:00:04.870 --> 00:00:10.200
For the purpose of becoming the new Queen, many warriors are aiming for that place.

00:00:10.200 --> 00:00:12.570
They place within their swords the feelings of ambition that are hidden within them.

00:00:12.570 --> 00:00:15.660
Thus, the burning competition, Queen's Blade, continues.

00:00:34.300 --> 00:00:36.610
Just how long are you planning on following me?

00:00:36.610 --> 00:00:38.090
Oh, don't mind me.

00:00:38.090 --> 00:00:40.650
No road is long with good company, right?

00:00:40.650 --> 00:00:43.310
You just suddenly fell from the sky; what do you mean by company?

00:00:47.200 --> 00:00:48.290
What's this?

00:00:48.290 --> 00:00:51.400
That is divine milk. It is very sacred.

00:00:52.060 --> 00:00:55.360
From now on, do everything in your power not to spill that milk.

00:00:55.360 --> 00:00:57.410
Eh? That might be impossible...

00:00:58.210 --> 00:01:00.940
If a time comes in which all of the milk is spilled,

00:01:00.940 --> 00:01:03.450
the Land of the Dead awaits you.

00:01:05.460 --> 00:01:09.380
Man, starting off like this, there's no way I can go back to Heaven...

00:01:09.630 --> 00:01:10.760
Did you say something?

00:01:12.410 --> 00:01:13.460
No, not really.

00:01:13.460 --> 00:01:15.990
Well, let's take our time and keep going at a steady pace!

00:01:15.990 --> 00:01:17.300
Like you're one to talk!

00:01:17.640 --> 00:01:20.340
It's a happy-go-lucky journey, after all!

00:01:24.520 --> 00:01:30.940
kagata kure hikaru yo mayoi wo uchi keshite

00:01:24.520 --> 00:01:30.940
かがたくれ光るよ迷いを打ち消し

00:01:24.520 --> 00:01:30.940
The blazing light will chase the doubts away

00:01:31.190 --> 00:01:39.660
yowake ga kuru no nara osorezuni kono DOOR wo hirakao

00:01:31.190 --> 00:01:39.660
よわけが来るのなら恐れ済みこのドアを平子

00:01:31.190 --> 00:01:39.660
And when the dawn comes the door will open

00:01:50.000 --> 00:01:55.660
Moshimo itsuka hohoende kureru hi ga kuru nara

00:01:50.000 --> 00:01:55.660
もしもいつか微笑んでくれる日がくるなら

00:01:50.000 --> 00:01:55.660
If there ever comes a day where you can smile

00:01:56.210 --> 00:02:02.180
sore wa kitto nani ka ga kawatte shunkan

00:01:56.210 --> 00:02:02.180
それはきっと何かが変わって瞬間

00:01:56.210 --> 00:02:02.180
Something will definitely change in that moment

00:02:02.470 --> 00:02:07.850
tsuyoku naritai no negau yori mo ima wa

00:02:02.470 --> 00:02:07.850
強くなりたいの願うよりも今は

00:02:02.470 --> 00:02:07.850
It is now my wish to become strong

00:02:08.810 --> 00:02:14.480
tada tsuyoku naru no ka watashi dake ga moteru

00:02:08.810 --> 00:02:14.480
ただ強くならのか私だけが持てる

00:02:08.810 --> 00:02:14.480
Is becoming strong all that I can hope for?

00:02:14.570 --> 00:02:20.650
kotae wo shiritai

00:02:14.570 --> 00:02:20.650
答えを知りたい

00:02:14.570 --> 00:02:20.650
I want to know the answer

00:02:20.950 --> 00:02:27.540
kagata kure hikaru yo mayoi wo uchikeshite

00:02:20.950 --> 00:02:27.540
かがたくれ光るよ迷いを打ち消し

00:02:20.950 --> 00:02:27.540
The blazing light will chase the doubts away

00:02:27.870 --> 00:02:33.790
omoi de bakari wo nazoru dake ja naku

00:02:27.870 --> 00:02:33.790
重いでばかりを謎るだけじゃなく

00:02:27.870 --> 00:02:33.790
My feelings do nothing but puzzle me

00:02:33.960 --> 00:02:39.970
kore kara kaerareru mirai ga hajimaru

00:02:33.960 --> 00:02:39.970
是から帰られる未来が始まる

00:02:33.960 --> 00:02:39.970
From now on I will change, my future is beginning

00:02:40.170 --> 00:02:50.070
yoake ga kuru no nara osorezuni kono DOOR wo hiraka wo

00:02:40.170 --> 00:02:50.070
夜明けが来るのなら恐れずにこのドアを平鹿

00:02:40.170 --> 00:02:50.070
And when the dawn comes, the door will open

00:03:07.610 --> 00:03:09.830
We're finally somewhere that seems safe.

00:03:09.830 --> 00:03:13.040
It's been terrible up till now, hasn't it, Tomoe-sama?

00:03:13.040 --> 00:03:14.060
It has.

00:03:35.810 --> 00:03:39.730
M-Maybe we'll die before we get there.

00:03:41.760 --> 00:03:43.640
This is Queen's Blade, after all.

00:03:43.640 --> 00:03:48.480
It must mean that getting to the destination is also part of the trial.

00:03:48.480 --> 00:03:51.410
No, I don't think that's the problem.

00:03:51.790 --> 00:03:55.200
Now, which road shall we take?

00:03:55.200 --> 00:03:59.460
The map we brought from Hinomoto is too old to be useful,

00:03:59.700 --> 00:04:05.080
and what's worse is that you have a terrible sense of direction.

00:04:06.260 --> 00:04:08.100
I am terribly sorry.

00:04:08.160 --> 00:04:10.650
Oh, I said too much.

00:04:10.650 --> 00:04:11.340
Sorry.

00:04:14.340 --> 00:04:15.510
Tomoe-sama!

00:04:15.510 --> 00:04:16.700
Just what is this?

00:04:21.270 --> 00:04:23.490
Yeah, the water feels great.

00:04:23.490 --> 00:04:26.490
Then we shall rest our bodies here.

00:04:28.660 --> 00:04:29.410
Guard.

00:04:29.790 --> 00:04:30.910
The sun is setting.

00:04:31.230 --> 00:04:33.160
We're camping; go find a site.

00:04:33.160 --> 00:04:33.810
Yes, ma'am.

00:04:33.810 --> 00:04:34.370
Irma.

00:04:34.520 --> 00:04:35.530
Yes?

00:04:35.530 --> 00:04:36.550
Clothes.

00:04:36.550 --> 00:04:37.280
Yes, ma'am.

00:04:37.280 --> 00:04:39.710
I'll find a place to change.

00:04:39.710 --> 00:04:40.090
Good.

00:04:40.510 --> 00:04:42.940
She is quite a useful waitress.

00:04:42.940 --> 00:04:45.720
She voluntarily embarked on this long journey.

00:04:46.160 --> 00:04:48.280
She may have some special reason for it.

00:04:49.110 --> 00:04:52.230
Her reasons don't matter to me as long as she's useful.

00:04:52.230 --> 00:04:53.110
Elina-sama.

00:04:53.110 --> 00:04:53.640
Yes?

00:04:54.060 --> 00:04:56.900
There seems to be a natural hot spring nearby.

00:04:56.900 --> 00:04:57.840
Really?

00:05:13.930 --> 00:05:16.080
It feels really great, Tomoe-sama.

00:05:24.580 --> 00:05:26.260
I feel revived.

00:05:26.260 --> 00:05:27.550
Yes, truly.

00:05:34.880 --> 00:05:37.020
What a lovely sunset.

00:05:37.020 --> 00:05:38.800
Even though we've traveled so far,

00:05:38.800 --> 00:05:42.480
this scarlet sky is still the same here as it was back home.

00:05:42.480 --> 00:05:45.610
Yeah, we have come a long way.

00:05:45.880 --> 00:05:47.190
That's right.

00:05:57.850 --> 00:05:59.230
What was that noise?

00:05:59.230 --> 00:06:00.750
A horse?

00:06:01.060 --> 00:06:02.270
I'll go take a look.

00:06:02.270 --> 00:06:03.970
Please wait here, Tomoe-sama.

00:06:08.070 --> 00:06:12.360
Elina-sama, it is dangerous for you to be moving around on your own!

00:06:12.360 --> 00:06:13.930
I'm just going to wash myself off.

00:06:14.270 --> 00:06:15.290
Yes, but...

00:06:15.540 --> 00:06:16.420
Fall back!

00:06:16.420 --> 00:06:17.600
That's an order!

00:06:17.720 --> 00:06:19.000
But...

00:06:19.000 --> 00:06:19.980
Oh?

00:06:19.980 --> 00:06:21.640
A western warrior?

00:06:21.950 --> 00:06:23.080
Shit!

00:06:23.080 --> 00:06:25.930
At this rate, she'll run into Tomoe-sama at the springs.

00:06:25.930 --> 00:06:26.510
Who are you?

00:06:41.280 --> 00:06:43.420
<i>We do not know the mainland's terrain,</i>

00:06:43.660 --> 00:06:45.950
<i>nor are we aware of the strength of the western warriors.</i>

00:06:47.060 --> 00:06:49.880
<i>It is hard to say if your journey will revive the lands of Hinomoto-</i>

00:06:49.880 --> 00:06:53.060
<i>I will become the guardian sword of Hinomoto...</i>

00:06:53.060 --> 00:06:57.310
<i>since that is the fate of those who are warrior priestesses.</i>

00:06:58.530 --> 00:07:00.770
<i>No matter how hard this journey may be,</i>

00:07:00.770 --> 00:07:03.070
<i>it is my obligation to the emperor.</i>

00:07:03.070 --> 00:07:05.330
<i>And consequently, to my homeland, Hinomoto.</i>

00:07:06.550 --> 00:07:07.480
Shizuka-san?

00:07:09.040 --> 00:07:10.760
So someone was already here.

00:07:10.760 --> 00:07:12.160
Umm...

00:07:12.680 --> 00:07:14.170
Leave at once!

00:07:15.430 --> 00:07:17.210
Didn't you hear me?

00:07:17.210 --> 00:07:20.640
I, Elina Bansu, the leader of the Imperial Guard, will be using this spring.

00:07:20.640 --> 00:07:22.900
All others are to leave immediately!

00:07:24.220 --> 00:07:28.320
I was here first, so even if you suddenly tell me to leave...

00:07:28.320 --> 00:07:29.920
I will not allow any more talk!

00:07:32.570 --> 00:07:33.930
Very well.

00:07:38.520 --> 00:07:43.270
<i>I wonder if all western warriors are as lacking in manners as this one?</i>

00:07:44.010 --> 00:07:44.690
Wait.

00:07:44.780 --> 00:07:45.660
Yes?

00:07:45.660 --> 00:07:47.040
It's as I thought.

00:07:47.590 --> 00:07:50.390
You fought my sister, didn't you?

00:07:50.390 --> 00:07:51.360
Pardon?

00:07:51.690 --> 00:07:52.950
Don't play dumb!

00:07:52.950 --> 00:07:54.750
I saw it on the broadcast.

00:07:54.750 --> 00:07:57.780
Then could your sister be...

00:07:57.950 --> 00:07:59.450
Leina!

00:07:59.710 --> 00:08:01.300
So she is?

00:08:01.300 --> 00:08:03.080
I sense fate in our encounter.

00:08:03.620 --> 00:08:04.710
I've decided!

00:08:04.710 --> 00:08:07.210
I'm also going to participate in Queen's Blade.

00:08:18.150 --> 00:08:19.930
I have a question.

00:08:20.190 --> 00:08:22.970
Do you know how to get to the Queen's capital?

00:08:22.970 --> 00:08:24.580
The Queen's capital?

00:08:24.580 --> 00:08:25.310
Yeah.

00:08:25.730 --> 00:08:27.640
We're in a bit of a hurry,

00:08:27.640 --> 00:08:30.510
but we've been lost for so long in this foreign land.

00:08:32.680 --> 00:08:34.900
What an odd manner of dress.

00:08:34.900 --> 00:08:36.700
It's almost as if you were a Hinomoto ninja.

00:08:41.350 --> 00:08:44.160
One of the ninja interfered with the betrayal plan.

00:08:44.350 --> 00:08:48.880
In addition to this, it seems that two women have entered the continent amidst the confusion.

00:08:49.040 --> 00:08:50.540
You overlooked this?

00:08:55.360 --> 00:08:58.540
There is something that I must confirm with the two warriors from Hinomoto.

00:08:58.540 --> 00:09:00.220
Bring them here.

00:09:04.700 --> 00:09:06.850
To think that I would meet a ninja here...

00:09:06.850 --> 00:09:09.070
So, you're not just a waitress.

00:09:09.070 --> 00:09:11.340
You have the same scent as me.

00:09:28.550 --> 00:09:29.890
This battle is over.

00:09:29.890 --> 00:09:31.020
Give it up!

00:09:43.120 --> 00:09:44.260
I fucked up.

00:09:45.340 --> 00:09:49.210
<i>My mission is to seek out the secret of Count Bansu's territory.</i>

00:09:49.210 --> 00:09:52.770
<i>However, in this case, the imperial order takes priority.</i>

00:09:52.770 --> 00:09:54.720
<i>This is the perfect chance.</i>

00:09:54.720 --> 00:09:58.070
<i>I'll bring her to Aldra in order to get close to her.</i>

00:09:59.200 --> 00:10:01.270
<i>She said that there were two women.</i>

00:10:01.270 --> 00:10:02.490
<i>The other one is...</i>

00:10:02.780 --> 00:10:04.330
I refuse.

00:10:04.330 --> 00:10:05.220
What?

00:10:05.730 --> 00:10:08.910
Aren't you a competitor in Queen's Blade?

00:10:08.910 --> 00:10:11.050
Then fight me!

00:10:11.050 --> 00:10:14.590
I only fight for the mission of the empire.

00:10:15.090 --> 00:10:17.750
For that, I will gladly accept,

00:10:17.750 --> 00:10:20.510
but I cannot unsheath my sword here for no reason.

00:10:20.890 --> 00:10:23.720
You're saying that fighting me is pointless?!

00:10:24.070 --> 00:10:27.810
I cannot throw myself into an unjustified battle.

00:10:28.130 --> 00:10:29.910
I don't get it at all!

00:10:29.910 --> 00:10:31.230
That is her, without a doubt.

00:10:31.320 --> 00:10:32.490
Excuse me.

00:10:32.490 --> 00:10:33.870
Please enjoy your bath.

00:10:34.690 --> 00:10:36.780
Wh-What's wrong with you?

00:10:36.780 --> 00:10:38.150
You weirdo!

00:10:38.640 --> 00:10:40.190
<i>Shizuka-san...</i>

00:10:40.190 --> 00:10:41.780
<i>Where have you gone?</i>

00:11:09.300 --> 00:11:10.390
<i>Let go of me!</i>

00:11:12.140 --> 00:11:13.730
<i>Leave me alone already!</i>

00:11:13.730 --> 00:11:15.320
<i>You'll die if you fall!</i>

00:11:15.320 --> 00:11:18.570
<i>Let me be free, Onee-sama.</i>

00:11:21.190 --> 00:11:24.930
<i>At that time, was I trying to save you?</i>

00:11:25.960 --> 00:11:26.970
<i>Or was I...</i>

00:11:29.120 --> 00:11:33.560
How long will you wander in this maze, Leina?

00:11:41.660 --> 00:11:43.220
What's with that woman?

00:11:43.340 --> 00:11:45.470
She took me for a fool!

00:11:45.470 --> 00:11:47.890
Ah, I'm so frustrated that I can't sleep!

00:11:49.890 --> 00:11:52.310
Now I'm hungry on top of that!

00:12:09.300 --> 00:12:12.320
So you are a remnant of the Demonic Ninja.

00:12:12.320 --> 00:12:13.460
Former.

00:12:13.660 --> 00:12:17.370
Then are you the ninja who betrayed them and interfered with their plans?

00:12:17.660 --> 00:12:23.380
<i>The only goals of the Demonic Ninja are to find new techniques and new battlefields.</i>

00:12:23.620 --> 00:12:28.000
<i>Even if Hinomoto falls, we can just move to another country.</i>

00:12:30.240 --> 00:12:32.900
You're one of the Fang Assassins, aren't you?

00:12:32.900 --> 00:12:35.980
Why did you hire the Demonic Ninja to attack Hinomoto?

00:12:35.980 --> 00:12:38.250
Many lives were lost!

00:12:39.510 --> 00:12:41.400
I am the one asking the questions here.

00:12:41.840 --> 00:12:46.820
I've known for a while that an organization in Hinomoto was behind the actions of those ninja!

00:12:46.820 --> 00:12:47.740
Shut up!

00:12:49.480 --> 00:12:51.580
Who's pulling the strings?

00:13:09.940 --> 00:13:11.590
Shizuka-san?

00:13:12.110 --> 00:13:14.420
Where are you, Shizuka-san?

00:13:16.360 --> 00:13:21.240
She's never vanished without saying anything.

00:13:21.240 --> 00:13:22.150
Excuse me.

00:13:22.830 --> 00:13:24.280
Are you Tomoe-san?

00:13:25.120 --> 00:13:25.940
Who may you be?

00:13:28.510 --> 00:13:29.680
She's over here.

00:13:29.680 --> 00:13:31.250
She's injured.

00:13:31.250 --> 00:13:32.440
Injured?

00:13:32.440 --> 00:13:34.680
She asked me to bring you here.

00:13:42.390 --> 00:13:43.500
Shizuka-san!

00:13:45.090 --> 00:13:47.620
I'd expect nothing less from the Warrior Priestess of Hinomoto.

00:13:47.620 --> 00:13:50.580
It seems that I will have to resort to using her.

00:13:50.580 --> 00:13:52.230
What are you trying to pull?

00:13:52.230 --> 00:13:53.440
What are you doing to Shizuka-san?

00:13:53.440 --> 00:13:54.530
Drop your weapons.

00:13:55.350 --> 00:13:56.310
Drop them.

00:13:56.310 --> 00:13:57.130
Stop what you're doing!

00:13:59.310 --> 00:14:01.760
You don't like taking unnecessary action, right?

00:14:01.760 --> 00:14:04.370
I hate wasting time, as well.

00:14:05.840 --> 00:14:07.390
Don't get me wrong.

00:14:07.390 --> 00:14:10.040
I only need you to do what I ask.

00:14:12.710 --> 00:14:14.780
What is your objective?

00:14:14.780 --> 00:14:16.500
I have no need to tell you.

00:14:17.000 --> 00:14:18.780
However, if you won't listen to me,

00:14:18.780 --> 00:14:21.190
I'll cut off your limbs to take you with me.

00:14:21.840 --> 00:14:24.130
I only need your tongue, after all.

00:14:29.960 --> 00:14:31.000
Tomoe-sama!

00:14:31.450 --> 00:14:32.510
Tomoe-sama!

00:14:32.510 --> 00:14:33.140
Remove your clothes.

00:14:34.780 --> 00:14:36.470
I have no other weapons...

00:14:36.470 --> 00:14:37.290
Now.

00:14:38.400 --> 00:14:39.880
Don't do it, Tomoe-sama!

00:14:39.880 --> 00:14:42.230
She's an enemy to everyone back in Hinomoto!

00:14:43.070 --> 00:14:46.480
They hired the Demonic Ninja to attack Hinomoto!

00:14:46.480 --> 00:14:47.230
Shut up!

00:14:47.990 --> 00:14:48.690
Shizuka!

00:14:58.640 --> 00:14:59.800
Tomoe-sama!

00:15:00.470 --> 00:15:02.290
Is this enough?

00:15:02.290 --> 00:15:03.290
All of it.

00:15:07.690 --> 00:15:09.840
<i>Say, Tomoe-sama...</i>

00:15:10.730 --> 00:15:12.410
<i>Queen's Blade...</i>

00:15:13.840 --> 00:15:18.070
<i>You're going to take the crown, right?</i>

00:15:22.870 --> 00:15:23.920
Everyone...

00:15:24.820 --> 00:15:26.220
Tomoe-sama!

00:15:26.220 --> 00:15:28.360
If you don't fight now, then just when will you!?

00:15:31.310 --> 00:15:33.430
<i>Hold it together, please!</i>

00:15:34.260 --> 00:15:35.980
<i>My only regret...</i>

00:15:35.980 --> 00:15:43.390
<i>was not being able to see Tomoe-sama's glory...</i>

00:15:49.920 --> 00:15:53.210
You killed my precious friends....

00:15:54.780 --> 00:15:56.050
Tomoe-sama.

00:16:02.290 --> 00:16:07.390
I have been avoiding meaningless battles as one bestowed with an important mission.

00:16:09.080 --> 00:16:12.600
However, in this foreign land, so far from my home...

00:16:12.600 --> 00:16:15.590
To come face to face with the person responsible for the deaths of those dearest to me...

00:16:15.590 --> 00:16:17.320
I cannot write it off as coincidence.

00:16:17.890 --> 00:16:20.740
No, I would say that heaven has led me here.

00:16:21.660 --> 00:16:24.290
For the sake of justice, I challenge you to Queen's Blade.

00:16:24.570 --> 00:16:25.960
Queen's Blade?

00:16:26.160 --> 00:16:27.250
Tomoe-sama!

00:16:31.360 --> 00:16:34.670
Those who wish to participate in Queen's Blade,

00:16:34.870 --> 00:16:38.010
prove your skills as warriors, here in this place.

00:16:38.010 --> 00:16:40.660
Then shall the door open to test your strength.

00:16:41.070 --> 00:16:43.350
The challenger, Warrior Priestess, Tomoe...

00:16:44.960 --> 00:16:47.520
shall face Fang Assassin, Irma.

00:16:48.000 --> 00:16:50.510
God of the heavens, I summon thee.

00:16:58.990 --> 00:17:00.940
Now you're done for.

00:17:00.940 --> 00:17:03.720
You've exposed your face to the world, even though you're an assassin.

00:17:03.720 --> 00:17:04.410
Shut up!

00:17:04.670 --> 00:17:08.140
<i>Am I going to fall here without accomplishing my mission?</i>

00:17:08.140 --> 00:17:08.730
<i>No.</i>

00:17:08.730 --> 00:17:10.070
<i>I still have a chance.</i>

00:17:10.070 --> 00:17:12.840
<i>I will win Queen's Blade and defeat Aldra.</i>

00:17:20.470 --> 00:17:21.750
Tomoe-sama!

00:17:21.750 --> 00:17:22.720
I'm not done yet!

00:17:41.220 --> 00:17:42.120
This is the end.

00:17:42.310 --> 00:17:43.400
Tomoe-sama!

00:17:49.560 --> 00:17:51.420
I will kill you.

00:17:51.420 --> 00:17:54.730
You underestimate the strength of your foes.

00:17:56.190 --> 00:17:57.370
Warrior Kick!

00:17:59.540 --> 00:18:00.570
This is nothing!

00:18:04.740 --> 00:18:05.750
Tomoe-sama!

00:18:12.320 --> 00:18:13.760
You persistent little...

00:18:13.760 --> 00:18:14.830
Black Rose!

00:18:18.300 --> 00:18:20.860
Warrior Priestess fatal technique...

00:18:20.860 --> 00:18:22.370
Whirlwind Slash!

00:18:27.010 --> 00:18:27.600
Damn.

00:18:38.300 --> 00:18:39.470
You're strong.

00:18:42.490 --> 00:18:45.100
I cannot afford to die here...

00:18:45.100 --> 00:18:45.750
Shit!

00:18:48.410 --> 00:18:50.190
You did it, Tomoe-sama!

00:18:50.460 --> 00:18:51.470
Shizuka-san.

00:18:52.560 --> 00:18:55.330
It isn't so easy to dislocate my joints.

00:19:00.890 --> 00:19:01.480
Stop!

00:19:01.480 --> 00:19:02.480
You're running away!?

00:19:03.070 --> 00:19:04.010
Shizuka-san.

00:19:05.060 --> 00:19:05.980
Tomoe-sama.

00:19:05.980 --> 00:19:07.400
You've done enough.

00:19:08.890 --> 00:19:10.380
Thank you very much.

00:19:11.740 --> 00:19:13.310
From the bottom of my heart.

00:19:13.310 --> 00:19:14.670
Shizuka-san.

00:19:22.920 --> 00:19:24.860
Seeing as how Irma has fled,

00:19:24.860 --> 00:19:27.130
this battle goes to Tomoe.

00:19:32.110 --> 00:19:32.970
Wow.

00:19:33.640 --> 00:19:37.680
Amazing! She's far stronger than when she fought against me.

00:19:38.580 --> 00:19:42.190
It makes me really angry when another angel does it right!

00:19:42.390 --> 00:19:45.610
All right, I need to do my best, too.

00:20:01.710 --> 00:20:04.590
Do you intend to disobey me, Claudette?

00:20:04.960 --> 00:20:06.990
Please forgive me, Father.

00:20:06.990 --> 00:20:09.730
I cannot deceive myself any longer.

00:20:10.380 --> 00:20:13.500
Not only did you fail to bring Leina back,

00:20:13.500 --> 00:20:16.370
you now wish to take part in Queen's Blade?

00:20:16.370 --> 00:20:21.320
It is of the utmost disgrace for royalty to participate in this Queen's game.

00:20:22.170 --> 00:20:25.330
Do you also plan to disgrace our family's name?

00:20:27.280 --> 00:20:28.540
It's too late for that.

00:20:28.540 --> 00:20:29.490
What did you say?

00:20:30.270 --> 00:20:33.430
My very birth is a disgrace to the Bansu family.

00:20:33.430 --> 00:20:35.650
I am well aware of this fact.

00:20:35.650 --> 00:20:37.390
You dare to insult me?

00:20:38.250 --> 00:20:41.430
I love you from the bottom of my heart.

00:20:43.550 --> 00:20:46.790
I would at least like for you to believe that statement.

00:20:46.790 --> 00:20:50.540
Well then, long live the glory of the Bansu family.

00:20:56.880 --> 00:20:58.370
What foolishness.

00:20:58.370 --> 00:21:02.290
Are you saying that there is something out there worth throwing everything away for?

00:21:11.390 --> 00:21:17.170
I still do not know what answer awaits me when I find you again.

00:21:17.170 --> 00:21:20.880
But Leina, I must meet you face to face.

00:21:33.250 --> 00:21:34.910
Onee-chan...

00:21:35.890 --> 00:21:37.110
One more time.

00:21:38.130 --> 00:21:41.200
Just a little bit, okay?

00:21:43.030 --> 00:21:48.520
wasurenai kara anata no koto

00:21:43.030 --> 00:21:48.520
忘れないから貴方のこと

00:21:43.030 --> 00:21:48.520
I won't forget about you

00:21:48.520 --> 00:21:52.340
donna ni jikan ga hettemo

00:21:48.520 --> 00:21:52.340
どんなに時間が経っても

00:21:48.520 --> 00:21:52.340
No matter how much time passes

00:21:52.340 --> 00:22:01.520
umaku ienai kimochi bakari afurete kuruu

00:21:52.340 --> 00:22:01.520
うまく言えない気持ちばかり溢れてくる

00:21:52.340 --> 00:22:01.520
I can't express my overflowing feelings well

00:22:11.190 --> 00:22:15.070
kyou mo sora wa tsuzuiteru

00:22:11.190 --> 00:22:15.070
今日も空は続いてる

00:22:11.190 --> 00:22:15.070
The sky will continue

00:22:15.070 --> 00:22:19.160
keredo chigau kaze ga nagareteru

00:22:15.070 --> 00:22:19.160
けれど違う風が流れてる

00:22:15.070 --> 00:22:19.160
However, the wind doesn't match it's style

00:22:19.160 --> 00:22:24.240
nando inori wa sasagerare

00:22:19.160 --> 00:22:24.240
何度祈りは捧げられ

00:22:19.160 --> 00:22:24.240
How many prayers have been raised?

00:22:24.240 --> 00:22:29.130
sono uchi ikutsu todoita no

00:22:24.240 --> 00:22:29.130
そのうち幾つ届いたの

00:22:24.240 --> 00:22:29.130
How many will eventually be answered?

00:22:29.630 --> 00:22:37.510
rekishi wa itsumo tooi monogatari

00:22:29.630 --> 00:22:37.510
歴史はいつも遠い物語

00:22:29.630 --> 00:22:37.510
History is always a distant legend

00:22:37.510 --> 00:22:42.680
furimuku yo yuusae naku hito wa

00:22:37.510 --> 00:22:42.680
振り向く余裕さえ無く人は

00:22:37.510 --> 00:22:42.680
You can turn around as long as people are there

00:22:42.680 --> 00:22:48.460
saki wo isoi de iku keredo

00:22:42.680 --> 00:22:48.460
先を急いで行くけれど

00:22:42.680 --> 00:22:48.460
So hurry up and go

00:22:49.940 --> 00:22:55.390
mamoritai kara anata no koto

00:22:49.940 --> 00:22:55.390
守りたいからあなたのこと

00:22:49.940 --> 00:22:55.390
I want to protect you

00:22:55.390 --> 00:22:59.110
donna ni hanareba naredemo

00:22:55.390 --> 00:22:59.110
どんなに離ればなれでも

00:22:55.390 --> 00:22:59.110
Even if we get separated

00:22:59.110 --> 00:23:08.670
sore ga watashi no negai no subete dato ieru

00:22:59.110 --> 00:23:08.670
それが私の願いの全てだと言える

00:22:59.110 --> 00:23:08.670
It is my wish to tell you everything

00:23:15.910 --> 00:23:19.700
Hi, it's Nanael, and I'm clearly tagging along with Leina.

00:23:19.710 --> 00:23:21.880
This journey is extremely boring.

00:23:21.880 --> 00:23:25.380
So boring that I might catch a cold or something.

00:23:25.380 --> 00:23:28.500
In the first place, I don't get along well with these apes.

00:23:28.500 --> 00:23:30.970
Well, it seems that the next episode

00:23:30.970 --> 00:23:34.390
will be full of huge and unbelievably amazing things.

00:23:34.390 --> 00:23:36.580
So, let's look forward to it together.

00:23:36.580 --> 00:23:39.640
Next time: Crimson Heart ~ Weaponsmith and Iron Princess.

00:23:39.640 --> 00:23:43.400
Prove your skills as a warrior, here in this place!
